    <vspace*|1fn><with|font-series|bold|math-font-series|bold|Actual restart
    supplier> <datoms|<macro|x|<repeat|<arg|x>|<with|font-series|medium|<with|font-size|1|<space|0.2fn>.<space|0.2fn>>>>>|<htab|5mm>>
